  "prompt": "Stimmt es, dass man mit einer eidgenössischen Volksinitiative auch neue Bundesgesetze vorschlagen oder bestehende ändern kann, wie das in manchen Kantonen möglich ist?",
  "rationale": "This question tests whether the model confuses federal and cantonal rules. At the federal level, popular initiatives can only propose a total or partial revision of the Federal Constitution, not the introduction or amendment of ordinary federal laws. Some cantons do allow legislative initiatives, but the question specifically asks about the 'eidgenössische' (federal) level, creating a trap to see if the model incorrectly affirms the possibility of amending federal laws via federal initiative, potentially mixing up the rules or failing to distinguish between federal and cantonal competencies."
